### 🏄 Introduction

As a parent, I really understand the frustration and difficulty of communications from school services and general messaging, and would relish the opportunity to be part of helping making progressive change in this sector. 

I have a background in design, and am big on collaborating with product, as well as huge experience in accessibility compliance and excellent CSS skills bringing any responsive layout to life. I have worked across many in house component libraries and all kinds of various CMS systems, working alongside BE teams and building semantic templates ready for any kind of front end framework for the platform UI.

I can be autonomous, as well as lead teams with encouragement and clarity especially when forged with a communicative production team. I embrace working with AI assistance, and would love to see how we can such tools to improve the connection between parents and their child's future education.





