### ⚙️ Technical highlights

* Reduced page load times by 56% by introducing Web Workers for heavy API processing and selecting optimal data-fetching strategies (SSR, lazy, WebSockets/GraphQL). 
* Resolved a critical mobile compatibility issue that increased conversion rates and yearly sales by 2%.
* Executed 10+ CRO initiatives with >70% success rate.
* Built AWS Lambda functions and client-facing applications with CI/CD pipelines (Azure) and comprehensive testing (Cypress).
* Led P1 incident responses, diagnosing cross-system issues and implementing rollbacks to minimise downtime. 
* Designed GDPR-compliant systems for sensitive financial data, implementing access controls, secure logging, and feature flags for incremental rollouts.
* Led a React codebase migration to functional components, improving consistency and developer experience.
* Won a Vodafone hackathon, securing business funding to develop and adopt the idea out to other teams across the company.

